    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "The ber-..-an form",
     "texto": [
      "In some words, the root is repeated and takes **ber-** at the start and **-an** at the end: **kejar → berkejar-kejaran**. It often expresses a mutual or shared action; the meaning depends on each word."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Actions between several people",
     "texto": [
      "**Bersalam-salaman** means to greet each other by shaking hands; **berpeluk-pelukan**, to hug each other; **bersahut-sahutan**, to answer each other or call out to each other."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    }
   ]
